<title>HUNGARY: Pannon-Valto swings to pre-tax profit.</title>
<headline>Pannon-Valto swings to pre-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating result	    18.8 loss vs    75.7 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax result	     185.6 profit vs 402.9 loss</p>
<p>    Net sales			1.6	vs     0.6</p>
<p>    Other revenue		 49.8	vs     1.8</p>
<p>    Material expenditures	3.0	vs     5.6</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures    17.0	vs    20.7</p>
<p>    Depreciation		   3.8	vs     4.3</p>
<p>    Other costs		   24.3	vs    24.1</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	  22.2	vs    23.4</p>
<p>    Net financial income     204.5 profit vs 311.6 loss</p>
<p>	 Financial revenue     366.1	vs   325.8</p>
<p>	 Financial expend.     161.6	vs   637.4</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income   0.0	vs    15.6 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Pannon-Valto Rt is an asset management company. The company said the figures were prepared in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom + 36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
